{"time": 1754243654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709027001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1908072618]她的手轻轻搭在你的肩膀上，\"好孩子...我回来了，伊芙可以休息了。\"如同安眠曲一般的呢喃"}
{"time": 1754243660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "398891718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1199449180][CQ:at,qq=1040972910] (?)"}
{"time": 1754243667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050202346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是什么)"}
{"time": 1754243680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571318649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（压力诺）"}
{"time": 1754243687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839384215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=165519206]\"你想拜师吗？\""}
{"time": 1754243703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "398166307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（gbc主题曲，五个少女从天上跳下来（）"}
{"time": 1754243732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255747409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“莉夏姐姐可以收我为徒吗”期待的看着她"}
{"time": 1754243923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019817120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我只会用剑。\"她还是这句话"}
{"time": 1754243930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831130920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不行……睡着的话，就不能……再骗自己了”*拥抱着她，眼角分泌出苦咸的液体“明明我有很多话想跟姐姐说……但是姐姐却听不见”"}
{"time": 1754243983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468778728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“请莉夏姐收我为徒吧”跪下"}
{"time": 1754244084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720900514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1831130920]\"这样也没什么不好吧?\"她的话语里带着诱人堕落的蛊惑，\"伊芙...想说什么都可以说，我会全部记住的...\""}
{"time": 1754244146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826880603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=468778728]\"那好吧。\"她用剑鞘抬起你的脸，\"从今天开始，我来教你，我的剑术。\""}
{"time": 1754244167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128954103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（天翔龙闪？）"}
{"time": 1754244268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085563328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实是黄昏之剑)"}
{"time": 1754244316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348376496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父，我有个请求，我有不得不打倒的敌人，请把你剑法的奥义传授给我”"}
{"time": 1754244336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788072317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你要学天翔龙闪?)"}
{"time": 1754244336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828712767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来我真的是浪客剑心）"}
{"time": 1754244347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047139822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(必须把师傅杀了?)"}
{"time": 1754244356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744129289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不行……我不会说给你听”掐住她的手“谢谢你用她的声音说这么多，但到此为止……现在从她的身体里滚出去，请”"}
{"time": 1754244365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460610776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没看过剑心啊，还有这回事啊）"}
{"time": 1754244403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439749891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(笑了，飞天御剑的奥义就是要下一代用天翔龙闪杀了上一代)"}
{"time": 1754244465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567842489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1744129289]\"真凶啊。\"她用你姐姐的脸做出温柔的表情，任由手被你掐住\"可是，难得有这种乐子，你不觉得...我用这具身体很合适吗？\""}
{"time": 1754244540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274025468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=348376496]\"现在还太早了，诺诺。\"她收回剑鞘，\"而且，告诉我你的目标。\""}
{"time": 1754244578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211381675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，你们有猜到卡珊德拉的能力吗)"}
{"time": 1754244611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12595625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“短期目标是找到那两个出现在村里陌生人，长期目标是彻底击溃暗影议会....”"}
{"time": 1754244613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729130477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得怎么猜都会“不止于此”）"}
{"time": 1754244704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599888963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1567842489]“合不合适我不做评价，但是请，你，快，滚”*睁开眼睛"}
{"time": 1754244856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091529681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1599888963]\"诶...但是，我拒绝。\"她甩开你的手，用你姐姐的紫罗兰的瞳孔盯着你，\"不过...你可以再掐死我一次。\"她抬起你的手放在你姐姐的脖颈上"}
{"time": 1754244917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461268369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=12595625]\"...错了错了，短期目标是，好好学习我的剑术。\"她叹了口气，轻声的自言自语，\"这样你让露莉亚怎么跟上呢...\""}
{"time": 1754244956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069289012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父说的对...我会认真学习的”"}
{"time": 1754245050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324047205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2091529681]“……”扭头就走，顺便把胸针一起摘下踩了"}
{"time": 1754245241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886916430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=324047205]\"哎哎，真暴力啊。\"她弯下身捡起胸针，\"那我就不碍着大小姐的眼了。\"她把胸针放在你的桌上，哼哼着从你的衣柜挑出一件衣服，淡淡的声音传到你耳边，\"六年之后再见哦?\""}
{"time": 1754245295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582847225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚...肯定也会找到自己擅长做的事情，对了，我还有中期目标，想办法治好她的眼睛”"}
