{"time": 1754277509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321624830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你老缠着我干什么”*依旧不去看她，但也没把手抽出来“契约都签完了，怎么还不滚”"}
{"time": 1754277766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191359464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1632870205]露莉亚面朝着墙，半盖着被子，你注意到她也没有换衣服，只是把身上一层棉袄脱掉了"}
{"time": 1754277841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888857974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=321624830]\"诶...我也要像姐姐一样守望着小伊芙嘛。\"说着话的时候你们走到了书房门口，\"没有姐姐的话，小伊芙被人欺负了怎么办？\""}
{"time": 1754277859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244395398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚？你洗漱了吗，我帮你吧”"}
{"time": 1754277940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020706208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这儿是我家”*不多废话，加快脚步拐进书库"}
