{"time": 1754284988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649772792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=133389534]这个名为复活石的炼金法，在你看来也并不完善，很多地方有被涂改的痕迹，但是大多数素材都和金龙强挂钩，包括第一要求金龙的天鳞，还有一项你几乎没有什么印象的材料-不死鸟的心尖血"}
{"time": 1754285155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870402878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，神话生物……”*摇头，哗啦哗啦地翻回炼器的部分，靠在椅背上懒洋洋地看“相比下来贤者之石都没那么难搞了”"}
{"time": 1754285401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723287843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这可是帕拉塞尔苏斯留下的炼金法，哦..？在你们看来不应该有值得一试的加值吗？”对面的人接过你的话开口，“而且，你真的觉得有贤者之石吗？”懒洋洋的"}
{"time": 1754285615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042828176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1766162387]扶着墙自己站了起来，随后在室内摸索着去洗漱台的路线，显得小心翼翼。"}
{"time": 1754285624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960233046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1766162387]“小心点”在旁边默默的看着，随时准备去扶着"}
{"time": 1754285671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525172495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=723287843]“你见过金龙吗？”*专门看看霞龙鳞片炼制匕首的部分，随口问道"}
{"time": 1754285862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019589237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525172495]这部分的记载倒是比较清晰，但是为了适配龙鳞的强度，需求的陨钢似乎是非常珍贵的素材，据你所知在你家的城堡里并没有这种东西。此外，还需要一定的龙血举行开刃的仪式。"}
{"time": 1754285916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691900294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“为什么突然这么问？”你发觉她站起了身，走去了书架那边，“那个配方我可没有动哦？我觉得没有必要修改。”"}
{"time": 1754285957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58041434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1960233046]（你为什么不直接扶着呢）"}
{"time": 1754285973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348814066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(难道去了那边她就能自己洗漱了吗"}
{"time": 1754285977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345123467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为这时候上去扶大概率触发）"}
{"time": 1754285987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126957105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不用你帮我..我是不是很没用剧情）"}
{"time": 1754286058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840987982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=691900294]“金龙能存在，贤者之石为什么不能？”*合上书，开始头疼材料“从神秘性来说，半斤八两吧”"}
{"time": 1754286080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563220868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么她摸索着终于走到了洗漱台那边，轻轻掩上了门"}
{"time": 1754286106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414936770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且……”*趴在桌上，闷着开口“算了，问你个问题”"}
{"time": 1754286156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858082458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她似乎在翻阅什么书，随后回了你一句，“贤者之石是纯粹的人造物，本质是不同的。”"}
{"time": 1754286231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188213964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我问的不是这个。我要问的是”"}
{"time": 1754286241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105567016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“以后你的契约能不能写成我看得懂的样子”"}
{"time": 1754286274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294460583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟进去"}
{"time": 1754286335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716251716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我觉得我有点太强了，还是1d4随机从技能槽roll一个吧（bushi）"}
{"time": 1754286351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895858816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别急）"}
{"time": 1754286364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766206241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1754286365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672072589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（不知道，我现在都没有动过我的卡，看他们天天审卡的）"}
{"time": 1754286407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442221328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为我阵地做成还没写，哈哈）"}
{"time": 1754286415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437954133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=B0F53E3A47A50F4CFF9DCD6323BDF607.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQOX_sqL29gidi-LuIt2pTRgTNGoxjjaCD_Ciipn9SUuvCOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhDk_BS_grTyFW6pmvz4Jv-iegKR1g&amp;rkey=CAMSMOs7knhFTiuMbUEPHU2-5C14uIJR3mmULQlvUhYVl9b83SxDWI1CkNHBz8FqJ0N5cA,file_size=13411]"}
{"time": 1754286431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086348177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1294460583]你看着她找了好半天没有找到水龙头的位置，在洗手间里磕磕碰碰"}
{"time": 1754286458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126854946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚，这里”牵住她的手"}
{"time": 1754286489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461918055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "帮她打开水龙头，然后把她的手带到水龙头下"}
{"time": 1754286511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369754266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（倒也不是阵地，我有一堆东西也没动，魔力消耗也没有加，虽然也不急就是了。但是看他们的说法感觉强度夸张）"}
{"time": 1754286524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826485610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（都不简单）"}
{"time": 1754286535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619149126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想了想，姐姐死了就死了吧（bushi）还是画风最重要）"}
{"time": 1754286609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120292274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（都不简单，我原来是沙包）"}
{"time": 1754286633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898766905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(配合阵地感觉就像你马训练场的龙车"}
{"time": 1754286695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184462515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1105567016]“难道你还想和我多签几个契约吗？”她的话语中带着调侃，“这种事你找洋荷就好了，她的口头契约想签多少就签多少。”"}
{"time": 1754286742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763057745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我确信她不知道，且我确定你会知道”*叠上腿，笃定地看着她"}
{"time": 1754286883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335565315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“知道什么？嗯?”她放下了手里的书，你可以看见是一本种族全书，转头看向你"}
{"time": 1754286949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686087383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我姐姐，伊莉丝的灵魂在哪里？”*直直看着她"}
{"time": 1754287064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892248916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=461918055]她顺着你的手动，没有施加什么力气，房间里安静地只剩你们二人的呼吸。"}
{"time": 1754287192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947589312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=686087383]“哈？这种问题我为什么会知道？”她的嘴角挂着笑，“我现在不就是你的姐姐吗”"}
{"time": 1754287243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143919666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1892248916][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 慢慢的引导她，带她完成整个流程，然后帮她擦擦脸"}
{"time": 1754287323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411133123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（虽说好像要洗个澡）"}
{"time": 1754287349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656942274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（额，也不是不行）"}
{"time": 1754287431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040159685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你肯定知道。不然凭什么说能复活她？”有些不耐烦“难道会凭空诞生吗？”"}
{"time": 1754287840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870528798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚...要洗澡吗”"}
{"time": 1754288046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924896948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2040159685]“退一万步说，就算我知道，我为什么要告诉你？”合上书放回书架，“这种事情作为筹码才更合适吧？”"}
{"time": 1754288134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838396107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1870528798]“...我自己来...”你发觉她的脸涨红了一片，“...不要诺诺”"}
{"time": 1754288160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041078220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1924896948]“对，所以我问你能不能把契约写成我看得懂的样子”"}
{"time": 1754288338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308415537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1041078220]\"果然一种把戏只能玩一次啊。哎哎。\"她佯装遗憾摇了摇头，\"但是连看不懂的契约你都敢签，难道是我的问题吗？\""}
{"time": 1754288416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671498946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怪我对你们的道德水平有些不切实际的幻想”*皱眉“不会有下一次了”"}
{"time": 1754288613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153492231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯嚯?\"她走到你对面重新坐下，\"我也只需要这一次，比起我你不是更应该担心洋荷?只靠语言她就可以订下牢不可破的契约哦?\"说完她用手指遮住唇，像是期待你的答复，看向你"}
{"time": 1754288661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676268067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1838396107]“那我帮你调下水温..”"}
{"time": 1754288772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696534878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=676268067]\"嗯...\"你看见浴室里有供人洗浴的木桶，当然，热水是要自己去打的"}
{"time": 1754288798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878992524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=153492231]“那是她的事，而你前科太多了” *收好鳞片，把她先前在看的那本书拿过来翻看"}
{"time": 1754288883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940200147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "帮她把水温调好，然后接一木桶的水“露莉亚把衣服脱了吧，水已经备好了”"}
{"time": 1754289071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772946996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=878992524]\"看上去你还挺信她的。\"她似乎是觉得有点无聊了，靠着椅子有一搭没一搭地开口，\"你这种阴暗的性子，和她倒也挺合适的，毕竟她就是那种...啊啊，天然呆嘛。\"\n你翻开那本书，似乎是大陆上的种族志，但是你发现书的中页开始被黑点遮住了"}
{"time": 1754289173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261442609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1940200147]\"...那诺诺出去..\"她摸索到了桶边，试了下水温开口"}
{"time": 1754289235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559727293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我就在门外，有什么需要我的时候记得叫我”"}
{"time": 1754289280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016565931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她像是松了口气，你在门外听到衣服落地的声音，随后就是轻轻的入水声。"}
{"time": 1754289747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555052750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在门外乖乖的等着"}
{"time": 1754289927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904491158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=772946996]*看一眼有没有目录，边看边回“怎么，难道我不信就有的选吗？起码人家没有你这么恶趣味”"}
{"time": 1754290085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963052618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=904491158]目录当然也是一样的情况，黑点精准地遮住了每一个字，\"可惜，本来我还觉得你很有潜力呢。\"她伸了个懒腰，\"我用这张脸出去会有什么影响吗？\"她故意问到"}
{"time": 1754290613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49175031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1555052750]大概过了一会，你听见了淋漓的水声，紧接着就是一阵衣服摩挲的声音，\"呼...\"门被推开，露莉亚站在你面前"}
{"time": 1754290634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741463303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“洗好了？”"}
{"time": 1754290664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274076632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*懒得理她，反正不管自己说什么，她都不会放弃这个念头，索性换个话题“你想好了价码没有”"}
{"time": 1754291001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732162903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=741463303]\"嗯...\"她的头发并没有擦干，沾上了许多水汽，皮肤倒是因为泡水的缘故有些微红"}
{"time": 1754291030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101140622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1274076632]\"价码?\"她接着开口，\"什么的价码?\""}
{"time": 1754291092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904414281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“转下身，我帮你擦个头发”"}
{"time": 1754291130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968288408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“灵魂的位置，或者陨钢的位置，也行。别跟我说天上地下这种抽象东西”*把书放回去"}
{"time": 1754291307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461882147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1904414281]“嗯..”她慢慢转过身。"}
{"time": 1754291409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540744478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿毛巾帮她把头发擦干，然后稍微整理一下头发，随后把她直接抱回到床上“时间不早了，该休息了...”"}
{"time": 1754291412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111124202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1968288408]\"你还真是贪心不足。\"她站起身，走到你身前挑起你的下巴，\"只怕你是开不起价码。\""}
{"time": 1754291722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082886934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "睡觉睡觉"}
{"time": 1754291765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436729412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不妨先说说看，哪有你这么做生意的？”*躲开她的手"}
{"time": 1754291953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1499600163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2082886934]那么你抱着她回到了床上，劳累了一天，几乎很快就睡过去了。"}
{"time": 1754292151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674132241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=436729412]\"那好吧。\"她转过身扯出一张地图，\"陨铁这种天外的素材，很难说有什么确切的位置。\"她朝你伸出手，\"你的身份给我，我就告诉你，对你而言最好取得的那一块在哪里。\""}
