{"time": 1754305299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690568878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1629884738]\"你是这么想的啊？\"她倒是稍微惊讶了一下，然后就没有再说话了，等你结束训练回屋的时候，她似乎已经离开了，桌上留着那枚蓝宝石胸针，以及打开的水晶棺向你表明这里以前发生了什么"}
{"time": 1754305352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490075627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（下一步感觉就是自己躺进去了）"}
{"time": 1754305457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222937259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（跳过之前让我先埋个人）"}
{"time": 1754305617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696082829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*毕加思索，迈腿躺进棺中感受宁静"}
{"time": 1754306066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888412073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "棺中还残留着一些姐姐的味道，但除此之外，什么都没剩下。"}
{"time": 1754306251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707432814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1499600163]第二天的清晨，你比以往醒的都早，露莉亚似乎没有醒的样子，背对着你睡着，被窝里暖暖的"}
{"time": 1754306834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478669758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1888412073]这样就好，这样就够。如此想着，蜷缩着闭上眼入睡"}
{"time": 1754307187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008752927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "往日肯定会赖床的...但经历了昨天的事，该起床锻炼了，但是到时候露莉亚发现自己不见了会不会害怕呢....还是等她醒来吧，不过先去洗漱一下"}
{"time": 1754307360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588535517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=478669758]你做了一个姐姐被冰逐渐封冻住的梦，无论你在梦中怎么呼喊都没有丝毫回音，直到她被巨大的冰块彻底冻住，你被透入骨髓的寒意一瞬惊醒，并非在梦中，而是现实的寒意。"}
{"time": 1754307395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374258145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2008752927]等你洗漱结束，露莉亚依然没醒，倒是门口先传来了敲门声"}
{"time": 1754307436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995905075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去开门看看"}
{"time": 1754307543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955201491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然不出意外是莉夏，她看见你开门，爽朗地拍拍自己的腰，\"哟，早\""}
{"time": 1754307581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111518673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是要开始教我了吗，师父”激动的看着她"}
{"time": 1754307844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913917987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=588535517]“噗哈——”隔了不知多久，胸腔重新剧烈起伏，从机体的low power警报中紧急自救，颤抖着睁眼"}
{"time": 1754308007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979186629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "颤抖的眼看见了你绝对不想看见的人和绝对不想看见的风景，金发白袍的少女手拿着不知道为什么在她手里的你眼熟的羊皮纸，盯着你桌子上的蓝宝石胸针一动不动，但你明显感觉到寒意就是从她身上散发的。"}
{"time": 1754308022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904384225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=111518673]\"一日之计在于晨，当然要从早上开始。\"她点点头"}
{"time": 1754308022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997210567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哈哈）"}
{"time": 1754308059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774637531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emm，我给露莉亚说一声吧，要不等会醒来她找不到我可能会感觉到害怕”"}
{"time": 1754308342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559312305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=979186629]“……”*叹口气，硬着头皮开口“晚上好”"}
