{"time": 1754321250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749039230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那体质很差了）"}
{"time": 1754321329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036105442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "可能是昨天太累了，没跑多远突然感觉腿一软，摔了一跤"}
{"time": 1754321375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732413086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼....”慢慢爬起来，想到死去的亲人朋友，继续往前跑..."}
{"time": 1754321407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541637485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=565430017]“……契约上还说了什么吗？如果六年后，我们都还活着的话。会发生什么”*咬着嘴唇等待着宣判"}
{"time": 1754321436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943373190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嗯...\"她在背后看着你，想了想，把包里的一些东西拿出来扔在地上，你定睛一看，居然真的是石头"}
{"time": 1754321761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461594352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1541637485]\"哦...你没看懂。\"她平铺直叙，也没有嘲笑你的意思，就好像，只是稀疏平常的事情，\"你做不到的话，会被咒杀。她...\"她看了看羊皮纸，\"没有代价。\""}
{"time": 1754321794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272541482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...”没有说什么，现在能做的只有向前跑"}
