{"time": 1754322666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552416711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此时天已经有些透亮，周围的人们开始出来扫雪，\"回去吃饭，休息一会，试试你的根骨。\""}
{"time": 1754322687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008716789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=752013854]“没有了”想了想，还是这么回答“我没再听她的”"}
{"time": 1754322730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328844140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得...咳咳咳”强忍住直接瘫到地上的冲动“谢谢师父”"}
{"time": 1754322780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083900030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……但是我也不好意思来找你。所以之前没告诉你”"}
{"time": 1754322896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781574574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1328844140]她帮你拍了拍背，顺了一会气带着你回到了旅馆，这会已经有一些客人在用餐，小镇旅馆的早餐并无山珍海味，只有一些平常的食物。"}
{"time": 1754322951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074371369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等会可以给露莉亚带一些吃的回去吗”"}
{"time": 1754323070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786398802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2083900030]\"哦。\"她扫了一眼棺材，\"没关系，你姐姐的事情，我应该没什么办法了。\"随后她转身向外走，\"那个交易好像也不能成立了。\"边走边说，\"你也不用当洋荷的宠物。\""}
{"time": 1754323312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85795901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2074371369]\"嗯。\"她随便要了点面包和牛奶，\"诺诺自己点吧。\""}
{"time": 1754323345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395241468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“和师父一样就好，谢谢师父”"}
{"time": 1754323387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999857754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "轻轻“嗯”一声，并没有感到轻松。把棺盖一点点推上，在封死之前最后说出四个字“我叫伊芙”"}
{"time": 1754323460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093500506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1395241468]虽然说是剑士侠客，但她的食量似乎不大，你感觉这么多不够分给露莉亚"}
{"time": 1754323538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166909224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1999857754]\"哦，伊芙。\"你看着她已经走到门口，突然停下来回头看着你，似乎有些...疑惑?\"已经天亮了，你还要睡一会吗？\""}
{"time": 1754323631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139954890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是睡……只是这样能稍微……安心一点”*把盖子彻底封上"}
