{"time": 1754324335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451245268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=824596722]你推开门，发现她静静地坐在床上，似乎已经醒了一段时间"}
{"time": 1754324397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253434724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我给露莉亚带了一些吃的呢”放桌子上，然后搬个椅子到旁边，带露莉亚去那里坐下"}
{"time": 1754324402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104216833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……为什么？”*揭棺而起，一副看傻子的眼神“……我知道你很厉害。但你也不能……这样子吧。你不会是那什么卡珊德拉拌的吧”"}
{"time": 1754324685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544940898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253434724]\"嗯...\"她也许是有些接受了，全程都很安静"}
{"time": 1754324698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641192543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后喂露莉亚吃"}
{"time": 1754324741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633009520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=104216833]\"原因?我已经讲过吧?\"她看着你，也没什么情感的波动，暗橘色的眼睛里很是无神，\"另外，只是想这么做\""}
{"time": 1754324918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269044446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚今天有什么想做的事情吗....今天练习结束之后我可以陪你一起去哦”"}
{"time": 1754325005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407054768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...想让诺诺不要烦我。\"她喝了两口牛奶，才慢悠悠开口"}
{"time": 1754325064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658524740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是，我……你”*一时语塞“我知道你不怕，但也……啊啊，我不知道怎么说了”*有些抓狂“……你有病吧？”"}
{"time": 1754325077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064378544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...”有点失落，委屈巴巴的说“好吧..”"}
{"time": 1754325474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389963468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1658524740]\"嗯?不用怕，小蛇。\"她皱着眉很是费力想了想，\"伊芙，嗯....难道能不能成功，对你而言都是可以接受的事情吗？\""}
{"time": 1754325525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533927383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2064378544]\"只是在房间里的话，可以。\"她挥挥手要赶你走，\"去找莉夏姐吧。\""}
{"time": 1754325584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181013626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那等会见...拜拜”扶她回到床上，然后收拾一下，去找莉夏"}
{"time": 1754325652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587719205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1389963468]“……难道我说不能，你就愿意替我去死？……”*从棺材里站起来追过去“凭什么啊？”"}
{"time": 1754325690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422213033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1181013626]她还在那坐着吃饭，很是有条不紊，完全不像是一个久经沙场的战士。"}
{"time": 1754325740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549489155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我回来了，师父”等她吃完"}
{"time": 1754325831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269732775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1587719205]\"洋荷很无聊啊。\"她不是很理解你的情感波动，微微歪着脑袋，暗橘色的瞳孔眨了眨，\"而且，照看小辈这种事，算是本能吧？\""}
{"time": 1754325887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693141613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1549489155]她把木刀递给你，紧接着端起自己的牛奶，\"去院子里对着雪人试一试。\""}
{"time": 1754325972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105977557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？雪人吗”师父让这样做一定有她的深意，双手郑重的接过木刀，随后来到院子里，摆出战斗的姿势"}
{"time": 1754325982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029179547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（过武器使用？）"}
{"time": 1754326054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489810903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对)"}
{"time": 1754326076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809116777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+4 剑"}
{"time": 1754326076, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1809116777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]使用[剑]演奏出:[1D20+4={16}+4=20]"}
{"time": 1754326128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626189777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=269732775]“……就那么无聊，命都可以不要？”有些恨铁不成钢地瞪着她“……成不成功，我真的，都能接受。没道理让你替我付账”"}
{"time": 1754326187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408707289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "作为猎人而训练的武器技术还算过硬，你很精准地向雪人的不同致命部位发动了打击，但雪人完全没有崩落，只是在表面留下了淡淡的钝击痕，\"哇哦，不错哦，可以在我的雪人上留下痕子。\""}
{"time": 1754326234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974855087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（12岁就有岩垣露16岁的水平了（bushi）"}
{"time": 1754326272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487620936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父好厉害，居然能把雪人弄的这么坚硬”看到仅仅只留下了痕迹有些吃惊"}
{"time": 1754326324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96150700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=626189777]\"嗯。我知道你都可以接受，刚刚我也说你都可以接受，那为什么要生气?\"她伸手摸摸你的脑袋，你第一次感觉到有些温暖，甚至有些过于美好了，那是一种发自心底的感觉，\"我也没替你付什么?\""}
{"time": 1754326350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879278674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1487620936]\"接下来，你的任务，就是想办法用木刀把这个雪人打碎。\""}
{"time": 1754326359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197017883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有点像芙丽莲对费伦说的话)"}
{"time": 1754326414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693703405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是，师父”一般来说连接处应该是最脆弱的地方，就朝着雪人的脖子位置砍"}
{"time": 1754326558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523277307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先砍五刀"}
{"time": 1754326564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896977629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r5#d20+4"}
