{"time": 1754326582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334249696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（今天出目还不赖啊）"}
{"time": 1754326656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079771128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(别急，冰冻三尺，非一日之寒)"}
{"time": 1754326675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305334063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你除非出5个20，不然你今天都剪不断)"}
{"time": 1754326708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028785165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好硬....”"}
{"time": 1754326785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062092183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "要不换个地方，也许应该去砍雪人的底部"}
{"time": 1754326793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604888138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r3#d20+4"}
{"time": 1754326793, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1604888138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]演奏出: 1D20+4= \n{3}+4=7\n{15}+4=19\n{17}+4=21"}
{"time": 1754326796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183262120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你慢慢砍)"}
{"time": 1754326815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655780419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（一直砍到出5个20？）"}
{"time": 1754326896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282798828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=96150700]“因为签契约的是我，被骗的也是我。所以付代价的就该是我，不是你！”双手架在她的肩膀上晃她，眼睛通红，声音却越来越声嘶力竭“为什么要教我怎么杀你……要是我真的忍不住怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1754326942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626929340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这时候她轻蔑一笑，无妨，你杀不了我）"}
{"time": 1754327119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620471190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她说那就死才真的很厉害（）"}
{"time": 1754327136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23099960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想想以前看的故事中的人都怎么做的，好像有位前辈通过气味，调整呼吸找到了找到了砍断石头的方法，不妨效仿一番"}
{"time": 1754327172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565592489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "深呼吸，将刀收于腰间，然后去感受气息的流动..."}
{"time": 1754327180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812687289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（水之呼吸）"}
{"time": 1754327186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792683017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=282798828]\"那你就...不忍呗?\"这句话或许有些破坏气氛，但是她就这么水灵灵的说出来了，\"我不介意的，而且...\"你注意到她的瞳孔有了些变化，你注意到先前从未见过的尖锐竖瞳，其中流露的威压让你的动作一怔，\"洋荷是长辈。\""}
{"time": 1754327205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796242807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r10#d+4"}
{"time": 1754327205, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1796242807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]演奏出: 1D20+4= \n{10}+4=14\n{6}+4=10\n{11}+4=15\n{6}+4=10\n{19}+4=23\n{20}+4=24\n{9}+4=13\n{10}+4=14\n{8}+4=12\n{3}+4=7"}
{"time": 1754327304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877987485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "上午的时间转瞬即逝，你多连的挥刀最后也没造成很明显的变化，直到莉夏拍了拍手，\"嗯嗯...停\""}
{"time": 1754327362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654529934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有点提心吊胆“师父...我表现怎么样”低头不敢看她"}
{"time": 1754327460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521526831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不错不错，看来我随手收的徒弟很有天赋。嗯...\"她皱皱眉，\"不过攻势讲究不动如山，动如雷霆，你的攻击太绵密，失了锐气。\"她认认真真地点评"}
{"time": 1754327564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581862743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到前半句感觉非常开心，激动的看着她“谢谢师父，我会记在心上的”"}
{"time": 1754327573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987699838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1792683017]“你……”感受到代沟的无力感“……我介意……我不想让你死。你不该死”"}
{"time": 1754327835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78154492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1987699838]\"...嗯?小蛇原来介意这个?\"她的眼瞳回归正常，压在你肩头的压力消散，她今天没有梳头，并未怎么打理但仍很养眼的金发自然地垂下，\"但是小蛇签过字了吧？那就要遵守契约。嗯..而且，没什么比你的姐姐重要吧?\""}
{"time": 1754327942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885033018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1581862743]\"休息一下，下午继续。诺诺要做好今后的日子都是这样的枯燥。\"她说完似乎觉得有些过头，咬了咬嘴唇，\"半年?三个月?一个月?\"最后皱着眉自己想了起来"}
{"time": 1754328074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579235976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会坚持下去的...不管会有多久...”"}
{"time": 1754328358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684069573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=78154492]“你真是……哎，烦死了……怎么这么认死理啊”突然感到一种无力感，额头隔着自己的手指垂在她肩头“你这性子怎么活到这么大的……我学，我学还不行吗？我要……学到能把那份契约撕得稀烂，然后再把那个什么都干了的魔鬼一起扔回地狱里去”"}
{"time": 1754328556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620439126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=684069573]她偏了偏脑袋，没有动，让你的额头搭在她身上，\"唔...\"她真的思考了一会，\"可能是因为...洋荷很强。而且，洋荷是长辈，比小蛇年长很多很多很多。\""}
{"time": 1754328598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395578624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "吃中饭，然后给露莉亚带中饭"}
{"time": 1754328669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546109130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=395578624](平和的日常)"}
{"time": 1754328674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392097416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“莉夏师父真的好厉害啊，她堆的雪人简直金刚不坏，不管我怎么砍都只能砍一道浅浅的痕”"}
{"time": 1754328687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080528895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是我想吐槽，这样不就像是把露莉亚养在鸟笼里)"}
{"time": 1754328690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455873364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要是莉夏师父去打雪仗...好恐怖”"}
{"time": 1754328705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434312777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也想把她带出去啊（）"}
