{"time": 1754328865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204321390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=455873364]你发觉她只是静静地在听，只是偶尔点点头，并没有回答"}
