{"time": 1754329169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237088594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1062713837]\"不想出门，反正看不见。\""}
{"time": 1754329257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949726300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那出门可以听见各种各样的声音，可以锻炼一下你的听力...听说有的人失明之后把听力锻炼的特别厉害，和常人基本没什么区别了”"}
{"time": 1754329289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083184797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"她回答得有些不置可否，但并没有接受"}
{"time": 1754329314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888073345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1620439126]“好了好了，知道你是老东西了……”从她肩膀上起来，总算搞清楚和她交流的技巧“从哪里开始学？”"}
{"time": 1754329396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637559909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1888073345]\"先锻炼吧?\"她偏着头想了想，\"你现在的身体很弱，有风险。\""}
{"time": 1754329702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885312043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”沉默了，弱弱地说一句“我不喜欢运动……”"}
