{"time": 1754333018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211184531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那她现在孤苦无依，一个12岁小女孩，还瞎了，一个人怎么活下去呢（）"}
