{"time": 1754333552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960516082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚......”"}
{"time": 1754333559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114916870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……sh……水”*干透的嘴唇艰难分开"}
{"time": 1754333584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241360921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（太压抑了（bushi）"}
{"time": 1754333602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860708540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1960516082]你无从得知空无一人的时候她在干什么，或许...她就这么一直坐着，独自面对自己的黑暗世界。"}
{"time": 1754333700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839493391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=114916870]\"水?好哦。\"她停下了揉眼睛，继续把头埋在枕头里。但是你出奇地发现棺材里开始出现积水...并逐渐没过你的半身随后停下"}
{"time": 1754333755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729069318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“该吃晚饭了....我去找莉夏姐一下，你先吃着....”"}
{"time": 1754333793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320983402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你把晚餐放下，她没给你回复。"}
{"time": 1754333822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93162157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*很想一巴掌盖在自己脑袋上，但手抬不起来。衣服沾湿后更起不来了。只能扭过头去先润润嗓子"}
{"time": 1754333854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942989397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跑去找莉夏“莉夏姐，露莉亚的眼睛真的没有任何办法了吗...”"}
{"time": 1754334008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218507161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=93162157]起码潮湿的环境比刚才的干燥缺水让你感觉舒心很多，皮肤似乎也在缓慢吸收水分，扭头的时候耳朵虽然浸入水里，但并没有很难受的感觉。很快喉咙就没有了灼痛感"}
{"time": 1754334009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么办法都可以...我付出任何代价都行...”眼眶微微发红“露莉亚她...我真的好害怕....”"}
{"time": 1754334061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623518945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*起码能喘气了，再歇歇说不定就能起来了"}
{"time": 1754334158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344261303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=834480]\"当初我就跟你说了...不要带着她，这会让她更不幸。\"莉夏站在打开的房门前叹气，\"诺诺，这世上没有许愿机，不是什么事情都能轻飘飘地说一句付出任何代价就能解决的。\"摇摇头，\"她的事情，你要自己解决。\""}
{"time": 1754334252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522854270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=623518945]旁边的人似乎又睡着了，脸趴在你的枕头上，身上也没有盖被子"}
{"time": 1754334313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215227541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……难怪能养死猫”*心里这么吐槽着，在棺材里挣扎着起身"}
{"time": 1754334373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604944561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....对不起，师父...”低头哽咽“我太..贪心了，我出去冷静一下....”"}
{"time": 1754334428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399047908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "水分确实很助于霞龙的后裔，你浸泡了一会之后居然有了些力气，成功从棺材里坐了起来"}
