{"time": 1754335190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303469389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=622066895]他了然点点头，\"另外，伊芙小姐，还有一件事。\"声音压得更低，\"昨天有人看见一个和伊莉丝小姐长得有些相似的女孩从你的房间走出来...\""}
{"time": 1754335236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109298049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大家都在传...您...是不是有些不为人知的癖好...\"他说完就低下头，\"请小姐怪罪。\""}
{"time": 1754335268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1178598105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1331304205]快雪初晴，自然是万里无云的好天气，可谓月明星稀"}
{"time": 1754335311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872459813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好那么好，回家！"}
