{"time": 1754335403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695759990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……别管了”*叹了口气，甚至还有点喘，心想好不容易有听得懂人话的“帮我……拿点吃的”"}
{"time": 1754335405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658594405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但那里真的还算家吗，毕竟只是一所空房子...会不会之前的都是一场梦..总之就去了"}
{"time": 1754335411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797229326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你踏上无人问津的山路，踩着厚厚的积雪上山"}
