{"time": 1754356893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873233095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（重）"}
{"time": 1754356904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044708119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……真不识趣”把胸针放到里侧桌角，倒是想大快朵颐，但是身体的速度却跟不上，所以只能不情不愿地细嚼慢咽"}
{"time": 1754357277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95721589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“诶，反正这玩意总会回来”*思索“不如拿去卖钱？”"}
{"time": 1754357345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309547693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2097614040]()"}
{"time": 1754357427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441380215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2097614040]“嗯……来点？”看了看一桌子，估摸着自己是吃不完——哪怕刚刚做完了两个月的运动量"}
{"time": 1754357471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251105918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先继续爬山吧"}
{"time": 1754357800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836986094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=441380215]\"啊，可以。\"她坐到你旁边，毫不在乎和你坐在一张椅子上，倒是你感觉有点被她挤到了，之后就毫不客气地吃吃吃"}
{"time": 1754358050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932286805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1836986094]*挤不过她又站不起来，还不好意思赶她走，只能尽量发力不让自己掉下去"}
{"time": 1754358132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126670605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "p.s 本人趋近肉食动物，但是不喜欢肥肉，口味偏淡"}
{"time": 1754358328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614332356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她吃的倒是很快，你有点想象不到为什么她那种纤细的身材可以吃下这么多东西。不过虽然很快，她还是给你适当的留了一些可以吃饱还不怎么伤胃的茶点。\n\"呼...差不多了。\""}
{"time": 1754358393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44535131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1251105918]月色照彻万川，你则是独自走上上山的小路，下山用了半晚的时间，上山则是更久。"}
{"time": 1754358548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115364229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1614332356]“……你昨天也没吃东西？”*依旧慢吞吞，毕竟手也不怎么抬得起来。咀嚼的间隙问一嘴"}
{"time": 1754358770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885245466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"睡着了。\"她对你点点头，\"早上醒的时候看见了那个羊皮纸，直接过来了。\"你看得出她似乎还是一副睡眼惺忪的样子，揉揉眼睛，站起身给你让开位置，径直倒在你的床上。"}
{"time": 1754358926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905332180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”现在想想，她嗜睡好像是从把自己的黑鳞消除开始的“……消耗很大吗？”"}
{"time": 1754359112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597222210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=44535131]（到山顶了？）"}
{"time": 1754359126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337185849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也可以吧)"}
{"time": 1754359132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523628892", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1905332180][CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1754359278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908457994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1905332180]她拉过被子盖上，金发细碎地铺在被褥上，\"唔...还好啦。凡事总得有代价啦，不客气。\""}
{"time": 1754359491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442309764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……算了，你先睡着”*等总算有了些力气，身子暖和了些，就去浴室，把这身湿了又干干了又湿的衣服摘了，再把自己塞进温水桶里慢慢发酵"}
{"time": 1754359574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691515701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1597222210]在午夜时分，你终于走到了曾经的村落。"}
{"time": 1754359788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182786248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=442309764]温水温润地包裹住你，对于你们这些霞龙的后裔来说，这总是一件舒服的事情，几乎有些让你昏昏欲睡了。"}
{"time": 1754359815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514058080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "该说什么，有些近乡情怯了，一靠近村子就想大家母被杀的事情，可恶的暗影议会....深呼吸，努力平静一些心情，逃也似的跑到家里"}
{"time": 1754360430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656450286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1514058080]地面的血迹已经完全被厚厚的新雪盖住了，但是暗色的血迹依然随处在墙壁，石头的侧面等等凸起上清晰可见，让你知晓...这里曾发生的事情都不是梦。"}
{"time": 1754360449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119160323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不过...令你奇怪的是，一路走来没有看到尸体"}
{"time": 1754360474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337225682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*吐会泡泡，随后先拿肥皂好好保养一头矜贵的紫色直发，再拿浴球好好搓搓自己，感觉能搓下一层皮"}
{"time": 1754361001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523932994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1337225682]头发在今天发生的种种事情之后显得有点毛糙，皮肤则是有了些褶皱，精心护理竟落得如此结果"}
{"time": 1754361202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308258915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之，先回家取下钱"}
{"time": 1754361621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123137990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "幸好今天天气还不错，晚上还挺亮的"}
{"time": 1754361654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114496670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1308258915]你往家里走去，踏着积雪借着月光踏着深雪在深夜里吱呀吱呀地行走，走过日常要经过的曾是石碑的地方，当然如今已经见不到石碑，有一个站在那里，低头打量着地面。在月光下有些朦胧"}
{"time": 1754361695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88270810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看那人外貌，有没有穿什么奇怪的袍子"}
{"time": 1754361805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584873537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1523932994]“嗯……啧，得弄点质量更好的保养品了”看着自己梳下的浮毛，不免有些焦虑"}
{"time": 1754361922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378598238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1584873537]你觉得无论什么样的保养品，像今天这样的折腾，估计都是不怎么有效。"}
{"time": 1754361956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559348996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88270810]()"}
{"time": 1754361968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777254095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=86443DB091118469F87701E232CFA9A2.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR72Cr_4J1PEIJqErdRjam05QdIaBjw2gsg_woo64uIz9PyjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQMEVKi1mecvAj-sQguiS0QnoCu80&amp;rkey=CAISMEd3mp69-ID5EaJ1TDxxkK2XGnRgEJtLDqnsBlOU5s41UXTQ9cSL8inHmFhCPlshWA,file_size=191856]"}
{"time": 1754362099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867809631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个....你为什么在这里，是迷路了吗...”本来想直接不理的，但大晚上出现在这种地方还是让人蛮担心的"}
{"time": 1754362152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970858710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "蓝色的的连袖长裙，底边是一圈白色的蕾丝，在雪地里依然穿着长筒黑丝袜，金发的长发有些不自然的卷曲，瞳孔鲜红，脑侧佩戴着似乎是赤色金属的头饰"}
{"time": 1754362346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928754867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1378598238]“或许……”感觉水凉的差不多了，站起来准备擦干“该想想身体改造的事情了”"}
{"time": 1754362374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386921357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=867809631]你可以过一个灵感"}
{"time": 1754362389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148550139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1 灵感"}
{"time": 1754362389, "type": "reply", "message_id": "148550139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]使用[灵感]演奏出:[1D20+1={11}+1=12]"}
{"time": 1754362486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123349951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你是...?”她的话里有淡淡的不和谐感，你察觉到似乎有一种生硬的非生物感"}
{"time": 1754362522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228485314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我之前...住在这里..所以你是？”"}
{"time": 1754362540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825460647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1928754867]你很快就收拾好，泡完澡之后整个人确实精神了很多，但依然架不住浑身上下的过度疲劳。"}
{"time": 1754362707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585143965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1228485314]\"贾斯珀。\"她转过头，在月光下一双流转着紫色流光的赤红瞳孔向你盯了过来，\"...\""}
{"time": 1754362727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916990802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（贾斯汀比伯？）"}
{"time": 1754362814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39855037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "被她盯着感觉有点不舒服“..所以为什么你来这里...迷路了吗，还是别的什么”"}
{"time": 1754362983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680823728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"守护让我确认这里的石头。\"她盯着你，瞳孔里没有感情，虽然很美，但却只有冷冷的机械质"}
{"time": 1754363118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929708398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“守护是....？那块石头怎么了吗..”想知道当时具体发生了什么"}
{"time": 1754363146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000017851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总感觉视野还是偏暗，裹上宽松的居家袍，穿上拖鞋才发现脚底磨得全是泡。但是总归得秉持话事人的仪态，所以小步小步挪动"}
{"time": 1754363180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134408713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你显然没有看见所谓的石头，\"你见过?\"她显然没有理睬你的第一个问题，而是直接开口问询，踏着雪向你走了两步，你注意到，雪地上没有留下脚印，踏雪无痕"}
{"time": 1754363214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090053250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1000017851](挪去哪)"}
{"time": 1754363252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460362760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能去自己房间的沙发吧）"}
{"time": 1754363368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796143969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只知道..这里原来有个石碑..后来来了两个人...然后大家都死了...”语气中夹杂着愤怒和悲伤...一想到昨天发生的事情，就感觉胃里翻江倒海，想要吐，但强忍了下去..但眼泪却止不住"}
{"time": 1754363575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592673048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1796143969]\"有人把这里的东西挖走了。\"她确定了这件事，\"知道是谁吗？\""}
{"time": 1754363639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174503205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....我听到她们聊天提到了什么黑暗议会...然后我就逃跑了...”"}
{"time": 1754363677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904866758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=460362760]那你小步小步挪了回去，推开房门只看见洋荷毫无形象地睡在你的床上，称得上有些四仰八叉，被子挂在身上，剩下一半掉在地上，短裙的遮掩范围很是危险"}
{"time": 1754364005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828369405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*懒得管她，反正看着也不像会着凉的样子。把门反锁上，往沙发上像死鱼一样一躺"}
{"time": 1754364805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289603645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，翔哥说复制我的技能不如复制天宫安，有这么弱吗)"}
{"time": 1754364929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441619667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（天宫安太强了（）"}
