{"time": 1754365323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641718805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（而且天宫安用技能有副作用是因为她有病，我用的话好像就没有副作用，不会把我的命耗完）"}
{"time": 1754365379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078045129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？是这样吗）"}
