{"time": 1754379554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8832110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是她也没告诉我守护来哪，尴尬了）"}
{"time": 1754379563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885377718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1894152338]你自认为药效极强，即使是你的身体，也能做到快速凝血。正在你收好药之时，你的房门被人轻轻敲响"}
{"time": 1754379573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001423925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=8832110](你在这等，是打算天亮都不回去吗)"}
{"time": 1754379592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729963871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，先找找尸体吧）"}
{"time": 1754379610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978619838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1885377718]把药粉收好。感觉彻底完成了今天的所有活动指标，说不定该关机了……但是看一眼趴在自己床上的人，刚好打算去她的房间休息，于是恰好开门"}
{"time": 1754379712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561722160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想到她之前提到的用徽章可以见到守护，也许守护并不会来这里"}
{"time": 1754379745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000555258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "大家的尸体也不知道去哪了，哎，但是起码有盼头了"}
{"time": 1754379773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982478912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回去吧，回去的早的话，还能休息一会....早上醒来还要跑步呢..."}
{"time": 1754379816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480611970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=978619838]是你的管家赛巴斯，他低声说了一句叨扰，\"伊芙小姐，有客人来了。\""}
{"time": 1754379843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210512466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=729963871](找不到的，不是说过现场被清理了吗)"}
{"time": 1754379930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672627891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1000555258]（）"}
{"time": 1754379937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011974581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1982478912]（）"}
{"time": 1754379961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368300849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1480611970]“有客人找母亲不就好了，她不在吗？”*此时还有些哑"}
{"time": 1754380106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825112550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1368300849]\"主母已经招待过了...\"他的声音压的很低，\"似乎点名道姓了您...\"他的目光瞥向了床上的某人，迅速收回目光"}
{"time": 1754380122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838248101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（锁定的这么快？）"}
{"time": 1754380172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250793138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“找我？”*皱了皱眉“人现在在哪”*找杯水喝"}
{"time": 1754380238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505264527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1982478912]一路下山，你终于在天亮之前赶到了镇上，正准备回旅馆，你惊讶地发现旅馆的一楼还亮着灯。"}
{"time": 1754380330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040378453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不会是师父和露莉亚吧......抱着被责罚的心情回去了"}
{"time": 1754380429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956869612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的预感确实没错，莉夏坐在壁炉边烤着火，你看见她的靴子上也有着不少的雪渍，露莉亚则是在她身旁靠着她睡着了，身上披着一层毯子。"}
{"time": 1754380474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171890167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起...师父”"}
{"time": 1754380598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461042319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=250793138]\"在私人会客室...主母现在也在那里。\"他眉头皱了皱，而你则意识到来人的等级可能相当高，毕竟像你们这样的家族，除了接待最重要的客人，从来不会动用私人会客室。"}
{"time": 1754380801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810367816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1171890167]她示意你小声，把露莉亚轻轻放在椅子上靠好，身上披上毯子。示意你出去说话"}
{"time": 1754380963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310950792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "低头跟着她出去"}
{"time": 1754381016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635175479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=461042319]“好吧，我一会就过去”点点头，关上门，准备换正装"}
{"time": 1754381250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884300950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1310950792]你和她移步到了街上，这时的天空又开始下起小雪，在寂寞的街道上宛如某人的心境世界，莉夏看着你，没有先开口"}
{"time": 1754381269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735169162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=635175479](那你搭配)"}
{"time": 1754381404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010460209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父突然又要再负担两个人的生活消费.....看起来也不像有什么正经工作的样子....所以我回家取了一些钱，而且我想给露莉亚买一些解闷的事情...让她不至于一个人天天没有事干....”"}
{"time": 1754381483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676960490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（想了想，感觉喜多川海梦.jpg）"}
{"time": 1754381510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082534297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(喜多川英梨吧)"}
{"time": 1754381523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126979970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还是敲下字好了）"}
{"time": 1754381818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498571112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1010460209]\"你知道自己错在哪吗？\"她似乎无心分辨你无力的辩驳"}
{"time": 1754382029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753648341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不该一个人上山，留师父和露莉亚在这里担心我.....”"}
{"time": 1754382031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035075580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来那种正面不遮挡能看到腿的裙子款式是什么）"}
{"time": 1754382036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844691108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（战裙？）"}
{"time": 1754382174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864951197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那是什么)"}
{"time": 1754382184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570797311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（雌火龙护腿.jpg）"}
{"time": 1754382196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895947089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（或者冰咒护腿那种）"}
{"time": 1754382222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592645278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是礼裙）"}
{"time": 1754382352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416944082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "暗紫色皮筋把亮紫色长发在肩胛后收成一束，遮住一半露背装没能遮住的后背。上身是大体湖蓝，只有袖口、领口、下摆里衬和前胸龙纹为紫色的鲸骨裙。下装以黑色裤袜打底，外面罩着长宽都很克制的白边紫礼裙，脚踩一双黑色低跟筒靴，这一套下来给自己累够呛"}
{"time": 1754382761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140679533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总而言之，尽管身体的状态不是很好，但你总算是穿好了繁复的一套礼服，镜子前的人面色虽然有些苍白，但准备完全"}
{"time": 1754382911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341295771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*推门出去，去私人会客厅"}
{"time": 1754383027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481388425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=753648341]\"...我真的很想骂你一顿，虽然你才十二岁，你，把，露，莉，亚，卷，进，来，晚上却，把她一个人丢在房间。\"她似乎极力在平复自己的情绪，说话有些一字一顿，但噌噌冒出来的火气相当明显。"}
{"time": 1754383459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861025562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”"}
{"time": 1754383740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865454237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....对..不起，我...”"}
{"time": 1754383792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049019654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=341295771]一路上你一直看见一些佣人在忙碌，并且隔着一些距离还会有全副武装的卫士，整座城堡简直如临大敌，甚至在你身前带路的赛巴斯也微微有些紧张，你看见他一直攥着手心，手套皱在一起。"}
{"time": 1754383820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140069231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...露莉亚的眼睛好像有办法了...我碰到了一个人，她说有个叫守护的或许可以帮助露莉亚...只要用这个勋章就可以见到他”掏出那个物品"}
{"time": 1754383866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236208618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……管家，来的人是谁？”跟着往前走，心里也有些没谱"}
{"time": 1754383882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583366956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要问了，我们家和议会有关系吗）"}
{"time": 1754384087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074061408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(明面上没有啊)"}
{"time": 1754384200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839001546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=236208618]\"...天之守护的使者...\"管家小声在你耳边开口，\"统领四位守护神的至高存在...她怎么会派使者来这里...\""}
{"time": 1754384223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747188484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那还真是因为我（）"}
