{"time": 1754403172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441715284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“妈，这位……没什么架子”*压低声音“要不你先回去……？”"}
