{"time": 1754412685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361830555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"守护神的人!?你在哪遇见的。\"她有些顾不上仪态，\"呃...\""}
