{"time": 1754412994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713392584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(实际上rp的时候也很麻烦，但是，这是初心)"}
{"time": 1754413009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635771577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不然我早选剑车翔哥老祖宗了)"}
{"time": 1754413074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627265867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=780182204]\"她还说了什么?\"你看出眼前的莉夏竟然有些紧张"}
{"time": 1754413089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535370033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=907092593]（）"}
{"time": 1754413118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026365405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她问我知不知道现场被谁清理了，我说不知道...”"}
{"time": 1754413131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829367049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=907092593]\"...\"洋荷侧过头看了看你，\"小蛇没意见吗？\""}
{"time": 1754413238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056136091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后我告诉了她我看到的事情...她就飞走了...”"}
{"time": 1754413247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688414889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是我想到我能芝麻开门)"}
{"time": 1754413250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038901070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好开心)"}
{"time": 1754413286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303785601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我……”*突然想起来今天早上被迫绕城堡跑了不知道多少圈，腿还在发软，于是“随便”变成了“……我考虑考虑”"}
{"time": 1754413302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643456367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2056136091]\"...她把徽章交给你的时候说了什么。\"你看见她听到现场清理的时候眉头微微皱了一下，倒是先开口问询这个"}
{"time": 1754413411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607793767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她说守护之后会来，我可以用这个见到他...请他帮忙”"}
{"time": 1754413582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210330696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=303785601]\"那就是同意了/那就是不同意了。\"埃忒尔和洋荷同时开口，一个语气轻快，一个有些对抗的意思。\"我觉得埃忒尔只需要提供资源就够了。\"洋荷的气势不知何时变回慵懒的样子。\"诶...难道我司掌的拒绝的魔法，伊芙小姐不感兴趣?\"她的语气耐人寻味，\"死亡亦可拒绝～\""}
{"time": 1754413615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698910851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=607793767]\"...你知不知道守护是什么人?\"她看上去头痛的不行"}
{"time": 1754413678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160580289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头“应该是很厉害的人吧，也许能让露莉亚复明....”"}
{"time": 1754413820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847469172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1160580289]\"听我说..\"她的双手搭在你的肩膀上，\"其他的守护或许还好...但是现在只剩下天之守护了，诺诺，那是个在不知道什么高处待了几百上千年的宅女，虽然姑且有在好好工作，但那家伙可不是什么什么都干的好人。\""}
{"time": 1754413912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728894360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她绝对是....\"她整理了好久措辞，\"...恶趣味犯了。\""}
{"time": 1754413922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745995557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=210330696]“咕……”*咽了口口水“我确实很好奇，但我也……不是很急着想杀洋荷。而且……”抬头看一眼这两位，犹豫了半天“我有点怕你们……把我玩死”"}
{"time": 1754413974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533371000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可是....露莉亚她....”"}
{"time": 1754414036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842271153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1533371000]\"听我说!现在的问题不是露莉亚的眼睛，而是那家伙真的盯上你了。\""}
{"time": 1754414073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483714613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，师父.....可是我就是一个普通人.”"}
{"time": 1754414098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630106670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她那样的大人物...为什么会盯上我呢”"}
{"time": 1754414105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317681737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼...\"她不知道是出于什么原因笑了一下，几乎在一瞬间解开了你头上的缎带"}
{"time": 1754414124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79235388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "可谓原形毕露，\"我看诺诺也是白长了脑子。\""}
{"time": 1754414127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760265751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还给我...不要...”"}
{"time": 1754414159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635782680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她叹了口气，把缎带还给了你，\"还不明白吗？\""}
{"time": 1754414188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129070529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "重新小心绑好了缎带"}
{"time": 1754414223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482033721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，师父，看样子我...闯了很大的祸..”"}
{"time": 1754414270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556615097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "握紧拳头低着头，一时不知如何是好"}
{"time": 1754414312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823058000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1745995557]\"所以说，跟着我比洋荷有前途哦?\"她在你的对面交叉双手，透过斜着的手背看着你，\"而且洋荷根本就是一直在睡觉吧？哪有好好教人。\"\n洋荷对此倒是不置可否，似乎也有点无所谓，\"埃忒尔虽然不太靠谱，但偶尔还是靠得住的。\""}
{"time": 1754414407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323490210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=556615097]\"...\"沉默不会消失，只是会转移，现在轮到她一言不发了，\"我们得快走。\""}
{"time": 1754414442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375832648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来守护是嘛玩意啊）"}
{"time": 1754414472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502771761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我看你们也没问啊)"}
{"time": 1754414479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381773613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(接得挺自然的)"}
{"time": 1754414500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249802901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了师父，那个守护...到底是什么”"}
{"time": 1754414615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979221116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1823058000]“……”*拍拍额头，感觉要长脑子了“那要不就……”叹口气，感觉欠了比魔鬼更难缠的卖身合同“一起吧”"}
{"time": 1754414819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449705297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她清了清嗓子，\"...数千年前，一名六翼天使宣称接到下凡清除污秽的神旨...在凡间找到了四个愿意护佑生灵的存在...水之守护神萨雷法，地之守护神米维，火之守护神梅拉托亚和风之守护神雷伊....她自己则自称天之守护神埃忒尔...\""}
{"time": 1754414841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479290494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（雷伊是）"}
{"time": 1754414857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214020478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（雷伊是）"}
{"time": 1754414891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332351986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那听起来...她不是好人吗？”有些疑惑"}
{"time": 1754414916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108661285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1249802901]紧接着她继续开口，\"...中间发生了一些很惨烈的事情...\"皱着眉，\"只是记录已经被抹去，我们现在知道的结果只有...地神陨落，水神沉睡，火神疯癫被拘禁，风神下落不明....\""}
{"time": 1754414934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206159705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是）"}
{"time": 1754414937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921311795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（夜叉）"}
{"time": 1754414980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474820362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如今只剩下那个高悬于天的天之守护...虽然她是很辛苦啦，但是找起乐子可是不知道会做什么...\"她干巴巴地解释"}
{"time": 1754415003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862168001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（会做掉我吧可能）"}
{"time": 1754415032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092342090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父...和那个守护之前有过往？”"}
{"time": 1754415050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283359179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"咳咳..我不认识。\"她急忙开口"}
{"time": 1754415080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508570052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可是...师父的表现有些奇怪”"}
{"time": 1754415179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240523720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1979221116]\"不过要用我的方法来，埃忒尔太远了。\"洋荷皱了皱眉，\"所以挂个名字就行了。\""}
{"time": 1754415270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749837415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*不知道为什么反倒有点求救地看看另一边"}
{"time": 1754415304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538247784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "埃忒尔则是沉默了一下，你突然有了可怕的猜想，她之所以这么说，似乎证明了先前窥探精神并非毫无所谓，但紧接着她开口，\"那怎么行，我好歹也算是参与者，当然要有参与感，让贾斯珀在这边盯着?怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1754415325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360252249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=538247784](所获)"}
{"time": 1754415385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144216830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"完不成训练的话，我会让贾斯珀拒绝她的休息这一概念。\"\n\"哦?嗯嗯，听上去不错。\""}
{"time": 1754415394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145051222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1754415444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219576954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=508570052]\"绝对没有哪里很奇怪!\"她敲了一下你的脑袋，你感觉好像鼓了个包"}
{"time": 1754415487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132384442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起..师父...但是露莉亚的眼睛真的没有什么能再看见东西的方法了吗....”"}
{"time": 1754415547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199609804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我……呃，我……”似乎是冷静了一些，试探性对贾斯珀的方向提问“……埃忒尔……小姐？已经发生的死亡，有办法拒绝吗？”"}
{"time": 1754415614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180889813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=199609804]\"哦?\"那双赤色宝石一般的瞳孔转过来时，你竟从中看出一丝玩味，\"伊芙是怎么想的呢？\""}
{"time": 1754415642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976734385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=132384442]\"魔导器。\""}
{"time": 1754415654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410957135", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我不应该说的，这样你一辈子就在治啊)"}
{"time": 1754415663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682941343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我不应该说的，这样你一辈子就在治了"}
{"time": 1754415680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319431551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那你很狠了（）"}
{"time": 1754415715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948905430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗...”眼睛发光看着莉夏“但是之前..师父你不是说没办法么”"}
{"time": 1754415747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329527565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个魔导器要去哪里搞....”"}
{"time": 1754415767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056456009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会很贵吗...”"}
{"time": 1754415805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290232142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉好像看到了希望，激动的一直询问着相关事宜"}
{"time": 1754415807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829303532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不知道……我想不到可以的样子”摇摇头“洋荷……师母也说她没办法，但我想试试……”"}
{"time": 1754415933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231353061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=290232142]\"...好了好了，今天就这样。\"她有些头疼，\"去睡一觉，我们准备离开。\""}
