{"time": 1754416253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092491760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1829303532]\"哼...\"你听见了这声轻哼，\"我可以做到。\"但紧接着的话给你泼下冷水，\"但我绝对不会去做。拒绝未来之死是守护之意，拒绝已过之死，是对亡者的亵渎。\"你在这话中听出了警告"}
{"time": 1754416366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743133840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回去睡觉了，顺便把露莉亚也给抱回去..."}
{"time": 1754416403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637818142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1092491760]“嗯……”轻轻点点头，表示知道了“我没奢求您替我做。但我依然会这么尝试……您应该知道的……我没有那么在乎对错”"}
{"time": 1754416438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757360522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1743133840]露莉亚大抵确实是累了，睡得很沉，你把她抱到床上，她也依然睡着"}
{"time": 1754416546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371516692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想着露莉亚恢复视力的那天..感觉终于又遇到了好事，到时候一起练剑，她可能还要叫我师姐，怀揣着对未来的憧憬睡了"}
{"time": 1754416616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662381521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637818142]\"...洋荷很好，切莫辜负。\"洋荷靠着沙发昏昏欲睡，此刻半眯着眼睛，埃忒尔走到你身旁在你耳边留下一句，随后退开，\"看来历史总是轮回不是吗？\"她笑得很和煦，\"不过一点琐事。\""}
{"time": 1754416733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731834653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*默默点点头，大概心里只剩最后一个问题"}
{"time": 1754416841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015456765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=371516692]看来你做了个梦，梦境中是一片白茫茫的雾气"}
{"time": 1754416850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023024964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=731834653](那你问)"}
{"time": 1754416899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061457346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“起雾了...我该去哪？”四处走走"}
{"time": 1754416907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630116532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "既然洋荷看起来很想睡觉，那就问埃忒尔“为什么是我？”"}
{"time": 1754416947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558500483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"奇怪的问题。\"她掩面轻笑，重新坐了回去，\"很重要吗？\""}
{"time": 1754416997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923399306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2061457346]不管怎么走似乎都一样"}
{"time": 1754417043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137035249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可能不重要，但我有些好奇……毕竟我觉得我不是个好人，世俗意义上”这么想着“我还以为今天您是来杀我的”"}
{"time": 1754417056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731431293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“路在哪...要不飞起来看看”摇摇头笑笑“人怎么会用翅膀飞呢”"}
{"time": 1754417094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842531874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有人吗”喊一声"}
{"time": 1754417416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925405265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1842531874](怎么还在催眠自己)"}
{"time": 1754417420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150888221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你是人吗)"}
