{"time": 1754417443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267819407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我觉得我是）"}
{"time": 1754417561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259207970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2137035249]\"洋荷愿意相信那些缥缈的可能的话，我也想看一看命数会如何编织...\"她看上去心情不错，\"而且，我不需要杀你，你的头上本就悬着一把剑，不是吗？\""}
{"time": 1754417644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144873045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1842531874]\"这边哦?\"温柔的声音从雾中传来，你天然想亲近"}
{"time": 1754417667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682828099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过去看看“真的有人啊”"}
{"time": 1754417709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153227967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随着你的靠近，迷雾逐渐消散，你的面前出现了"}
{"time": 1754417760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252359748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我可能会为了我的目标继续把其他人卷进来，在剑落下之前。这样也没关系？为什么不找一些……更好的人？”*双手握在身前“我问的有点多，但是……为什么不是伊莉丝？”"}
{"time": 1754417907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624470801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=147DB3EBF64C692708423EBFCEE55F13.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQhamYTQOHU5x8Ig9lq0DQYPsvV8xi08wQg_woo9vvqgKT0jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQWBuI-xaPC9peZE6PnjlWGnoCHRU&amp;rkey=CAISMMXzgXfDo4TaazelSJWLV931oTAlr9pWCl9NbyAMCrxxhQREKM5NIfiZNctNIWDemA,file_size=80308]"}
