{"time": 1754418106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223753206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1252359748]\"就和你问我为什么是你一样，这个答案有，但很重要吗？\"她依然是这个回答，\"至于...把其他人卷进来?有洋荷在，我为什么要担心?\""}
{"time": 1754418128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696406339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好漂亮啊...”"}
{"time": 1754418210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813140153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=696406339]\"谢谢～\"她的声音清脆悦耳，如同清晨鸟儿的鸣叫，从中还包含着温馨的暖意"}
{"time": 1754418241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353993372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧……打扰了”一手背在腰后，一手放在胸前躬身致意"}
{"time": 1754418254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273050993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这里是哪 天使姐姐”"}
{"time": 1754418341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981784265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=353993372]她笑眯眯地，\"反正...时间也没有多久，对不对?我想观赏的命运，只会演绎...\"她伸出六根手指，\"这么久而已。\""}
{"time": 1754418381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459624836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=273050993]\"这里是我的天空岛哦?小姑娘，我叫埃忒尔，你叫什么名字?\"笑容和煦让你如沐春风"}
{"time": 1754418387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343522788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然没什么问题，但是伸出六根手指总感觉听起来不太对）"}
