{"time": 1754418726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586803470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....我不喜欢那个样子...”"}
{"time": 1754418836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563624681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是任性...\"她看着你，突然一切的和煦都烟消云散，周围的风景从阳光明媚变得阴沉，\"喜欢给别人添麻烦，自说自话，假装很努力，弄出不切实际的目标激励自己，嚯...果然是魔族吗？\""}
{"time": 1754418850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145770726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=343522788](人呢)"}
