{"time": 1754419023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479455086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一阵风吹过，缎带越吹越远，在你眼前消失"}
{"time": 1754419023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898190585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不要这样...”"}
{"time": 1754419036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511158136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大概……有一点点猜想。难道说用亮晶晶？”"}
{"time": 1754419124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38165809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要抓住飘走的缎带，但可能是太害怕了摔了一跤，只能看到它越飘越远，只能朝缎带伸出手“不要....不要走....”"}
{"time": 1754419214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107907578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1511158136]\"你要是能找到雅尔贞特，那倒是最她会喜欢的。\"她如是开口，\"宝石...你看她身上...有什么饰品吗？\"\n洋荷似乎已经睡着了，靠着沙发起伏。\n你母亲则是适时地离开了这里，凭她的头脑，你觉得不久就会有一些有趣的传言开始流传了。"}
{"time": 1754419228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845373837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(删掉最)"}
{"time": 1754419267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593538814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=38165809]她依然跪坐在地上，翅膀展开，你感觉无比害怕，\"本性如此吗?\""}
{"time": 1754419463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038959253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“银龙啊……听起来也好遥远。看起来好像也不能在家里窝下去了”*陷入思索“哦……不过我倒是挺想知道卡珊德拉现在的表情的……可惜了”"}
{"time": 1754419554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256489425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么....不要走...”"}
