{"time": 1754419640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240294435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1256489425]\"明明是一个魔族...却一直欺骗其他人自己是人，你还真是狡猾。\""}
