{"time": 1754426887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349928191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想来你今晚也不太可能睡得着了，露莉亚同样如此，\"...想出去走走。\""}
{"time": 1754426915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167041778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，但不能走的太远了..要不师父又担心了”"}
{"time": 1754427021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857373603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么，久违地，你和她再次走在室外的晴朗中，是夜无雪无风亦无行人...月光倾泻，省略描述"}
{"time": 1754427035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528729791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(懒得写了，你自己品吧)"}
{"time": 1754427053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510463561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去洗漱了，换身衣服，然后对着镜子思考良久，看着那根消失的发带还有点不适应的感觉，但看到自己完全是人类的外貌，又感到很满足"}
{"time": 1754427057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981386412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你打的有点快）"}
