{"time": 1754461388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681575765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那剑现在在哪，我们快去取吧”有些激动"}
{"time": 1754461427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751859699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"别急，我们要先试一试，你适合什么样的武器。\""}
{"time": 1754461494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517334417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，不是剑吗？”"}
{"time": 1754461496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082985428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=786966072]母亲坐在里面，带着一脸温婉的笑看着你进来，\"伊芙，你来了。\""}
{"time": 1754461509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363523294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父之前不是说自己只会剑么”"}
{"time": 1754461571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375399014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就算是剑，也有不同的类别和流派。\"她敲敲你的脑袋，\"师傅我是只带了一把长剑，不是只会用长剑。侠不死于徒手，在武器一途最好做到百无禁忌\""}
{"time": 1754461634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924557335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "捂住自己的头，委屈巴巴的看着莉夏“知道了师父...那我们怎么测呢”"}
{"time": 1754461683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858725668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2082985428]“嗯，看起来有重要的事？”闲散地坐到母亲旁边“两位师母今天都没来找我”"}
{"time": 1754461741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327392594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1858725668]洋荷?大概还在做梦，至于贾斯珀，则是一整天都没见人。"}
{"time": 1754461811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470256342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你注意到母亲的桌面上摊着一封请柬，\"嗯...伊芙，你应该知道东境的马纳利亚密会吧？\""}
