{"time": 1754495184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134203115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=75349674]\"哦，虽然说扔给你了，但是这匕首很锋利，千万不要伤到自己。\"莉夏叮嘱到，\"我这几日不在镇上，诺诺不要到处惹祸，知道吗？\""}
{"time": 1754495212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489356469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？师父要去工作了吗，可以带我去涨涨见识吗”"}
{"time": 1754495286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000101917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"倒也不是工作。\"她拍拍你的脑袋，\"给你的武器准备一下素材。\"点点头"}
{"time": 1754495306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679845271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（点点头是可以带上我吗？）"}
