{"time": 1754495544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071360388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧..师父路上千万要小心”"}
{"time": 1754495553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953522299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我和露露会乖乖等你回来的”"}
{"time": 1754495686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428800466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1060414717]\"嗯...这件事守护那里已经知道了，但是...\"她停了下来，为难地看着你"}
{"time": 1754495721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110158912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=953522299]\"哟。\"她对你露齿爽朗一笑，\"我很快就回来，别惹麻烦哦?\""}
{"time": 1754495785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156987763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是？我的训练不会放假？”"}
