{"time": 1754501439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301502587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那锐雯怎么办）"}
{"time": 1754501550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924815850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=709393284]但是...这只鹿，在你眼中似乎已经死了...脖子上的伤口还在流出汩汩鲜血"}
{"time": 1754501618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617597995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚死不久吗...”拔出匕首警戒“不是露露就行....不过好像现在遇到危险的变成我了”"}
{"time": 1754501692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798699798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=771187300]她走出你的房间，走的时候仍然半闭着眼睛，等到气息彻底消失的时候，如你所料，桌上的蓝宝石胸针有节奏地亮了起来"}
{"time": 1754501737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203387573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1617597995]确实如此，你感觉到了潜藏在暗处的危险，是什么东西...杀光这片林子里的动物?"}
{"time": 1754501881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771156782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1798699798]*淡淡瞥一眼，开始配自己的药，反正它自己会出来没话找话的"}
{"time": 1754501925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348739493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "观察四周，仔细的听听周围有没有什么新的动静"}
{"time": 1754501981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746829645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1771156782]你手中的药粉开始不受你的控制，像是被人当做墨水书写一般，在桌上留下了，\"好冷淡\"三个字"}
{"time": 1754502036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260579217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=348739493]毫无动静，周围静悄悄的，如同发起狩猎前的寂静"}
{"time": 1754502071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680797111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我现在双武器还没大成的情况）"}
{"time": 1754502085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856302019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（单手拿匕首应该更强不）"}
{"time": 1754502155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095857635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1746829645]“……别捣乱”把药粉归拢回来“怎么，一个月没敢说话，憋坏了？”"}
{"time": 1754502252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430643526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1095857635]\"也还好啦，毕竟我现在就在过来的路上。\""}
{"time": 1754502289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925992984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的声音和你姐姐很像，但终归能听出些不同，大概也没有刻意模仿"}
{"time": 1754502296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659766269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=680797111](应该)"}
