{"time": 1754502678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500673675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还真是你，什么时候开始的？”*停下手中调的药，有种表情做给瞎子看的感觉"}
{"time": 1754502806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002653888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2013409053]猎人猎物..也许此刻是猎物和猎人，你和它都在林中一动不动，等待对面先露出破绽"}
{"time": 1754502888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436379722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=500673675]\"事先声明，不是我。\"她好像料到你的反应，\"只是我借用了她的脸。\""}
{"time": 1754502941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384541180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我倒是也没想到会这么巧，哎呀，稍微动一下就促成了呢...这件事。\"笑嘻嘻的声音"}
