{"time": 1754510228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709820845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……哦，那现在是不是该轮到我开价码了？”*坐起身来，开始思考什么"}
{"time": 1754510261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153532865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要什么呢）"}
{"time": 1754510309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214460590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是这份价码还不够吗？\"她坐在你旁边，指着自己"}
{"time": 1754510315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156194608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么见到银龙？姐姐的灵魂在哪里？卡珊德拉的弱点？龙晶？）"}
{"time": 1754510455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475784489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不要这个，在我的记忆里有很多，我记得很牢，你也删不掉”*眯起眼睛“我该问你要什么好呢？去找雅尔珍特？姐姐的灵魂？或者……你的弱点”"}
{"time": 1754510614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907597044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这可是我难得的开业酬宾。\"不客气地躺了下来，\"其他的条件，我可不一定答应，你说说看吧\""}
{"time": 1754510715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253612949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我答应了师母要给她回礼，而我姐姐的事，我早晚会自己弄清楚”"}
