{"time": 1754560578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517200964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "他们不是应该在抵御魔族的第一线吗？只是这个念头出现，你连同着露莉亚一起重重地摔倒在地"}
{"time": 1754560594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125447983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“人渣....披着人族皮的恶魔.....”"}
