{"time": 1754571835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228961292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚，现在是什么时候...”"}
{"time": 1754571849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128505859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是天使姐姐，是可爱学妹？）"}
{"time": 1754571886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981355653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=228961292]大概是看着看着就睡着了，很快露莉亚就醒了过来，她淡灰色的眼睛盯着你，眼泪在眼眶里打转，\"诺诺...\""}
{"time": 1754571923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984226560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别哭，露莉亚，我们不都好好的吗...”摸摸她的头，看眼外面天色"}
{"time": 1754571935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265618360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*说起来总感觉靠山没了，多少有点缺乏安全感"}
{"time": 1754571949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731643931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=984226560]这个房间并没有窗户"}
{"time": 1754571991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310087874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啧，毒牙也还没找够……”躺在床上，总感觉自己还是太弱小了"}
{"time": 1754572017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174061867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=894414764]对你而言这倒是难得空旷的时间，或者说也是难能可贵的闲暇，只能说一时之间还真有点不习惯?"}
{"time": 1754572028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864682439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这是哪...教会？”"}
{"time": 1754572051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577673619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "但你想到...明天或者后天，就会有怀特家的人上门"}
{"time": 1754572055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117698703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尝试起身"}
{"time": 1754572101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669490031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我已经懂了）"}
{"time": 1754572114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022091850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神肯定不是素材复用）"}
{"time": 1754572115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322193488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=984226560]“嗯...”她正要回答你，突然捂住了一侧的肩膀，“好疼...”"}
{"time": 1754572127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248483107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来真是素材复用）"}
{"time": 1754572143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678670287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你肩膀的伤还好吗，当时看起来好严重”"}
{"time": 1754572150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055370407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”*翻来覆去总不是个滋味。但是偏偏……还真想不出什么办法"}
{"time": 1754572197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137192450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？我明明没有受伤啊？”"}
{"time": 1754572220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827320163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（果然不是素材复用）"}
{"time": 1754572246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615545878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们从外面的林子找到了我吗？”"}
{"time": 1754572254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977343069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她感觉有些奇怪，“诺诺是不是又在瞎说了？”尽管她疼得有些龇牙咧嘴，“倒是诺诺，受了好重的伤，为什么要一个人...和狼群搏斗？”"}
{"time": 1754572279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224989734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“但是...”她点点头，接着有些疑惑，“为什么离镇子这么近呢？”"}
{"time": 1754572287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295562734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“狼群？我遇到了魔族...”"}
{"time": 1754572308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122254661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "刚刚的是梦吗，不行，哪会有那么逼真的梦"}
{"time": 1754572324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228218532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露我们快走，等会镇子会被魔族群袭击的”"}
{"time": 1754572333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461528906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1055370407]你整理着思绪，包括今天签下的契约...以及，她的怀抱..."}
{"time": 1754572399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58383690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=228218532]“诺诺在说什么？”她用另一边手敲了敲你的脑袋，“要是让莉夏姐听到，肯定又要笑话你了，你还把她的匕首弄丢了吧？”"}
{"time": 1754572448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223072744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我没有瞎说...露露你要相信我..我们快走..对了，神父在哪里，大家都得走..留下来肯定会死的”"}
{"time": 1754572455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126199952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*虽说这一个月有点被玩得没人权，但该说不说，还真……挺无忧无虑的。摸出那枚霞龙的鳞片，静静摩挲着"}
{"time": 1754572605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651833083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然龙晶可能不太行……这个呢？磨粉？”*陷入思索"}
{"time": 1754572672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1499214690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1223072744]“诶？我都听见了。”你听到门外传来莉夏的声音，“露莉亚，给我狠狠敲她的头，敲不死的。”随后门被她推开，一改平日里散漫的着装，她此刻穿着一套标准骑士轻甲，红衣飘飘，配合底下着的白衬衣显得英气十足，肩膀上则是绣有红色的分叉条纹"}
{"time": 1754572764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739483115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*一不做二不休，总之起床用锉刀磨那么一小小撮下来"}
{"time": 1754572774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339440687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=126199952]宽大的鳞片表面凹凹凸凸，你摩挲起来身心都感觉很舒适，但是要想研磨...也许你现有的工具不足以对其造成损伤"}
{"time": 1754572787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501464645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1754572810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869042817", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "真龙之鳞，而且这一片...似乎还是从特殊的地位取下来的？"}
{"time": 1754572810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546668060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父，你回来了？”"}
{"time": 1754572818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673482682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "真龙之鳞，而且这一片...似乎还是从特殊的地方取下来的？"}
{"time": 1754572853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137193141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不对..不对..等下...”思考“难道真的只是一场梦..”"}
{"time": 1754572943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457915455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*发现被磨下来的都是锉刀上的金属粉，又郁闷地躺了回去"}
{"time": 1754573027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830513002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*算了，睡觉。也许除了白手套，自己真的还需要一个亲卫……明天再说吧"}
{"time": 1754573082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594519212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=137193141]\"什么？\"她走上来准备拍拍你的脑袋，但临了变成了轻轻的抚摸，\"诺诺，我知道你很努力，但是...不要用过激的手段，一个人...能从狼群手中活下来...你这次很走运。\""}
{"time": 1754573121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358457765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉也不是单纯的回溯时间）"}
{"time": 1754573148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238733228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（群体意识修改？你看看镇上人口有没有少（）"}
{"time": 1754573167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236757321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（死了的人应该是不会复活的）"}
{"time": 1754573177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434609771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那龙神不用赈灾了？）"}
{"time": 1754573210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253641883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "检查一下自己的伤口，有没有邪恶的气息"}
{"time": 1754573218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302680559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那什么咒怨伤害）"}
{"time": 1754573240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850557489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这个应该顺手修了，我猜）"}
{"time": 1754573282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637965645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1830513002]你难得地陷入了一场无梦的安眠里"}
{"time": 1754573322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390295191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253641883]似乎没有什么诅咒的感觉，但是身体很虚弱，胸口和腰腹上的伤口都在"}
{"time": 1754573389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706073656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637965645]当然也不会有人来叫醒你，床上残留着淡淡的属于洋荷的气息，直到梦醒"}
{"time": 1754573397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667677776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你自己决定什么时候醒吧）"}
{"time": 1754573457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64140734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*大概是，早上九点。昨天该干的都干了，因此睡得格外无负担"}
{"time": 1754573462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236817710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可是师父..我做了个梦，梦里魔族包围了城镇...大家都死了...露露的肩膀也被魔族咬伤了，好严重”抱着师父哭"}
{"time": 1754573501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466472458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1236817710]她有些嫌弃地把你拉开，“别闹别闹，做个梦而已，你不是要当战士吗？”"}
{"time": 1754573549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969980046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=64140734]房间里静悄悄的，阳光洒落到床单上的时候，你睁开了眼"}
{"time": 1754573683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941491345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可是.....好吧...反正师父也回来了，就算来1w个魔族应该也没事吧...”"}
{"time": 1754573783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973044366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1941491345]“诺诺，是不是把我的匕首弄丢了？”她凶凶地看着你，忍不住敲了你几下，让露莉亚不由得睁大了眼睛，“对了...”叹口气，“这次被老东家逮到了，我们要跟着他们一起走了。”"}
{"time": 1754573811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630245022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“老东家是？跟这幅铠甲有关系吗”"}
{"time": 1754573837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707312830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "捂着自己的头"}
{"time": 1754573847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877062267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "偷偷的看她"}
{"time": 1754573914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349094387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……哈啊”睁开眼，先把帘子拉上，不想被晒。然后，大概……"}
{"time": 1754573926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672433657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看书呗，还能干嘛"}
{"time": 1754573965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368354340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后偷偷摸一下露露的受伤那边的肩膀"}
{"time": 1754573982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678643971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯，唉，说起来怎么这么倒霉，就好像被人精准定位了一样。”她叹口气，“阿尔贝尔的鼻子是猎犬吗？”随后她往后退两步到门边，用夸张的语气开口，“雷维翁骑士团所属-莉夏，恭请大团长阿尔贝尔卿。”啪啪啪，一边用手拍一边开口发出拟声词"}
{"time": 1754574048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549874822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1349094387]上午的时间流逝了少许，在太阳即将升到正空的时候，你的房门被人轻轻敲响"}
{"time": 1754574055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595208911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看向门边，有人来了？然后继续捏她肩膀"}
{"time": 1754574092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240510254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=595208911]“嘶...”她皱眉把你的手打开，看得出来很疼了，“别闹。”随后从床边退开。"}
{"time": 1754574199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417178967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“咳咳咳...”你听到门外传来爽朗的男子声音，“莉夏也真是，每次都弄这么夸张。”随后穿着一身劲装的短发男人从门外走进来，“而且，什么叫老东家，我们不是一直都是伙伴吗？”"}
{"time": 1754574216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295031147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D41C8375717F837FBB538BAF00B3C1BA.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTsFqa5UI8J9VnNPjpnajF6omGqGRihpBAg_wootprIpur4jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQy5Yzq7cQ_N_TYVi_r7rejXoCxNo&amp;rkey=CAQSMKaqzFX04y2whsahNEbR0AwN9HjfDCeGExGHbVc5P_avVwTbL2ZOyNfyn96HAWOMNg,file_size=266785]"}
{"time": 1754574222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153542042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(帅)"}
{"time": 1754574284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516428528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=549874822]*起来开门"}
{"time": 1754574341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095094872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不知道该怎么称呼，试探性的打下招呼“团长好？”"}
{"time": 1754574459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432272980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=516428528]赛巴斯站在门外，对你微微鞠了个躬，“小姐，客人到了。”你注意到今天的走廊里格外暖和，几乎和房间不相上下"}
{"time": 1754574501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587260765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1095094872]“哟！”他回了你个招呼，“她就是莉夏的弟子？”随后看向露莉亚，“这位又是？”"}
{"time": 1754574598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650776332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1432272980]“哦，怀特到了？比预期的快了一天啊”*皱着眉“我还没换好衣服”"}
{"time": 1754574613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498562754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她是我的朋友，莉夏师父收留了我们两个...”"}
{"time": 1754574628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143961643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“叫露莉亚”"}
{"time": 1754574635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290217821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“夫人在客厅等您。”赛巴斯点点头，侍立在门外"}
{"time": 1754574644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680850274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我叫诺薇拉”"}
{"time": 1754574764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658952938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=680850274]“姑且也算是我的弟子吧。”莉夏点点头，“这位是我们团团长啦，你们叫他阿尔贝尔大叔就行了。”莉夏上前拍怕阿尔贝尔的肩膀，“喂喂，我哪有那么大年纪。”阿尔贝尔反驳，随后也看向你，“诺维拉，还有露莉亚，你们今后愿意跟着我们雷维翁骑士团吗？”"}
{"time": 1754574774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636812934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=290217821]“行……”*关上门，打开衣柜，找些浅色的礼服吧"}
{"time": 1754574777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916157890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚把目光投向了你"}
