{"time": 1754576326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326186804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我房间桌上，有调好的补气血的药粉”*在路上理一下头发“让人煮上温着，备着吧”"}
{"time": 1754576437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105233588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2062969461]“阿尔贝尔卿可是双剑的好手，或者说顶点吧？”莉夏在一旁调侃地开口，“他比我适合教你双剑的流派哦？”"}
{"time": 1754576659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095590438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=326186804]他吩咐了一下下人，随后带着你抵达了会客厅"}
