{"time": 1754576766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968081034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833455166]\"我无所谓啊，反正按照阿尔贝尔卿所说，我们是伙伴嘛。\"她的手肘了肘阿尔贝尔"}
