{"time": 1754582802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948384662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1957450666]\"话可不能这么说，这不是把人送给你了？\""}
{"time": 1754582856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808607301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有什么用？”*还不如看看有多少礼金"}
{"time": 1754582947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394068198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1808607301]显然不会摆到明面上来讲，\"好啦，钱也不是你收，你反正只能拿到人不是?那位很漂亮吧？\""}
{"time": 1754582970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756886173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1823530517]完全消失，jpg，你甚至怀疑你的记忆错乱，从来没有过那个东西存在"}
{"time": 1754583055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184815047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=394068198]“光要好看我为什么不去养宠物，说不定比他还好养些。”*说是这么说，再看一眼"}
{"time": 1754583082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602273428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哎，先睡觉吧，说不定还能梦到天使姐姐"}
{"time": 1754583359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370079295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1184815047]齐肩的白色短发整齐地梳理在脑后，蔚蓝如天空的双瞳，此刻却阴云密布，没有高光，穿着的白色衣服上装饰着很多蓝色的四叶花，在头发一侧则是戴着一黑一白两只蝴蝶结"}
{"time": 1754583395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514419936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "样貌自不必多说，身高比你略矮一点，就是气质...总有些期期艾艾的"}
{"time": 1754583507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102010207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真阴冷，虽说怀特家确实冷嗖嗖的。但完全没有雪山的凛冽感”*和带他来的人对比一番“算了，不给我添太多麻烦就行”"}
{"time": 1754583673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126154115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1602273428]做了一个悠长的，什么都没有的梦"}
{"time": 1754583723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "592785990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1102010207]\"那不叫阴冷吧？明明是忧郁系，我以为小伊芙会很喜欢这一款呢？\""}
{"time": 1754583740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260413490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "醒来感觉有些空虚“天使姐姐...”"}
{"time": 1754583842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957954270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不巧，我也没那么喜欢自己。我看起来很像知心姐姐吗？”"}
{"time": 1754583916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396166227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之就先养伤，伤好的差不多就去训练了"}
{"time": 1754583930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967679640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1957954270]\"我觉得倒是没什么问题，放心啦放心啦。我很看好你们哦?\""}
{"time": 1754583975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457465929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1396166227]那之后大约过了三四天，你终于勉强可以下地走动了，露莉亚搀扶着你"}
{"time": 1754583989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381721640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉好像快进到结束了）"}
