{"time": 1754584397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233633075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1124717268]\"难道你在装傻?嗯...说不定是真傻。\"留下这么一句话，戒指从你的手上消失"}
{"time": 1754584434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181617643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "与此同时，这场为之后的密谈暖场的宴席也就差不多结束了"}
