{"time": 1754584620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720075457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1807893419]没有什么实质性的话，你的母亲邀请对方上首的那位男子进入私人的会客室就联姻一事详谈，其他人则是陆陆续续散掉了"}
{"time": 1754584645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271913418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "怀特一方散得很快，不一会儿只剩下琼恩一个人孤零零地坐在那"}
{"time": 1754584708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643830427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1716432467]\"你可别了，这几天躺得要死要活。\"她一边扶着你一边毒舌，\"唉，是不是增重了十几斤?圈里的都没诺诺会长\""}
{"time": 1754584739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881161403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哪有...露露真坏...”"}
{"time": 1754584763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044463947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "两个人隔着大半个厅堂，遥相并没有对望，总感觉有些不自在，索性站起来走过去，坐在他附近"}
{"time": 1754584810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818030111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“琼恩·怀特。觉得怎么样？我家”*单刀直入的话术，不知道是不是和洋荷待久了"}
{"time": 1754584902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131316781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1881161403]她笑了笑，扶着你上了马车，\"我们这趟路可不短。\""}
{"time": 1754584933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837306962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "马车上果然是莉夏，她大概也是因为你留了下来。"}
{"time": 1754584995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461366387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=818030111]\"...\"他抬起头打量了你一眼，随后又把兜帽拽紧了一些低下头看自己的鞋子，\"很..很暖..\""}
{"time": 1754585109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923120825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们目的地是哪”"}
{"time": 1754585129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264256095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然暖”*自然而然地叠起腿来“走廊两边好几个炉子，都快把我烤干了……你们不是白龙血裔……算了，不问了”*突然对血脉问题失去了兴趣“你们家就没给你好好调调？”"}
